# Licensed BADA 4 timestep-convergence gate in cached ERA5 weather. Run through:
#   python tests/research/run_convergence_study.py era5-convergence-bada4
# which runs it at 0.10, 0.05 and 0.025 s. Needs the ERA5 cache for
# 2025-08-15 12Z over 40,-5,45,5. Aircraft: CV0 capped 1000 fpm climb (exact),
# CV1 uncapped rated-thrust climb, CV2 thrust-limited level acceleration,
# CV3 uncapped idle descent, CV6 climbing 25-degree turn.
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === BADA 4 ERA5 TIMESTEP-CONVERGENCE GATE ===
00:00:00.05>DATE 15,8,2025,12:00:00
00:00:00.10>PLUGIN LOAD WINDECMWF
00:00:00.15>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.20>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.30>PERFMODEL BADA4
00:00:00.40>METEOCONFIG STRICT ON
00:00:00.45>WINDECMWF 40,-5,45,5
00:00:00.60>FF
00:00:01.00>CRE CV0,A320-232,41.00,0.00,90,10000,225
00:00:01.00>CRE CV1,A320-232,41.50,0.00,90,FL300,M0.78
00:00:01.00>CRE CV2,A320-232,42.00,0.00,90,FL100,250
00:00:01.00>CRE CV3,A320-232,42.50,0.00,90,FL350,M0.78
00:00:01.00>CRE CV6,A320-232,43.00,0.00,90,FL150,250
00:00:01.10>DYNAMICS CV0 TEM
00:00:01.10>DYNAMICS CV1 TEM
00:00:01.10>DYNAMICS CV2 TEM
00:00:01.10>DYNAMICS CV3 TEM
00:00:01.10>DYNAMICS CV6 TEM
00:00:01.20>ENVELOPE CV0 OFF
00:00:01.20>ENVELOPE CV1 OFF
00:00:01.20>ENVELOPE CV2 OFF
00:00:01.20>ENVELOPE CV3 OFF
00:00:01.20>ENVELOPE CV6 OFF
00:00:01.40>RECORDRESEARCH INTERVAL 0.10
00:00:02.00>RECORDRESEARCH START era5-convergence-bada4.csv
00:00:05.00>SPD CV0 220
00:00:05.00>ALT CV0 12000 1000
00:00:05.00>SPD CV1 M0.78
00:00:05.00>ALT CV1 FL320 4000
00:00:05.00>SPD CV2 320
00:00:05.00>SPD CV3 M0.78
00:00:05.00>ALT CV3 FL300 5000
00:00:05.00>BANK CV6 25
00:00:05.00>HDG CV6 270
00:00:05.00>ALT CV6 FL180 3000
00:04:00.00>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:04:01.00>QUIT
